{"4072850": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Isle of Food", "steam_appid": 4072850, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072850/extras/b983cd26357111c3ca767895eede77e1.poster.avif?t=1777564046\" aria-label=\"Environment showcase in Isle Of Food\" width=614 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072850/extras/b983cd26357111c3ca767895eede77e1.webm?t=1777564046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072850/extras/b983cd26357111c3ca767895eede77e1.mp4?t=1777564046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you cook when nothing is given to you?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Isle of Food</strong> is an open-world cozy VR cooking game where cooking begins outside the kitchen. There are no ready-made ingredients or shortcuts. To cook, you must explore the island to hunt, fish, gather, and farm everything yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only what you bring back can be cooked. Each dish is prepared by hand using natural VR interactions, and your progress depends on how well you manage your stylish island restaurant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world shapes your menu, and your choices shape the experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>CORE MECHANICS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ VR cooking with natural hand interactions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ 100+ real and fantasy recipes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Multiple cooking methods: baking, boiling, frying, grilling</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Open-world island exploration</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Hunting, Fishing, Gathering, Farming</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Day–night cycle and dynamic weather</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔  Restaurant management, upgrades, decorations and progression</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072850/extras/e81f2e2d05db6cab4356aee7a29efc9d.poster.avif?t=1777564046\" aria-label=\"Core mechanics in Isle Of Food\" width=614 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072850/extras/e81f2e2d05db6cab4356aee7a29efc9d.webm?t=1777564046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072850/extras/e81f2e2d05db6cab4356aee7a29efc9d.mp4?t=1777564046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>MAIN FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Isle of Food delivers a full hands-on VR cooking experience with simulation-level detail</strong>. You slice, fry, boil, bake and plate dishes using precise physical movements, crafting meals from 100+ recipes ranging from real-world classics to fantasy dishes made from rare island ingredients.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every recipe begins with open-world island exploration.</strong> Ingredients must be found through activity: hunt wildlife, track birds, fish along the coast, gather fruits and herbs, or grow your own crops near the restaurant. A day–night cycle and shifting weather affect what appears and when, forming a core part of your cooking progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072850/extras/5651e55b89b567afd2b25c8ab52675e6.poster.avif?t=1777564046\" aria-label=\"Cooking in Isle Of Food\" width=614 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072850/extras/5651e55b89b567afd2b25c8ab52675e6.webm?t=1777564046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072850/extras/5651e55b89b567afd2b25c8ab52675e6.mp4?t=1777564046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A NEW COOKING EXPERIENCE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Guests set the pace of your restaurant management experience.</strong> Each day brings visitors with different tastes — from simple starter requests to complex dishes that require rare ingredients gathered across the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Service hours create a natural gameplay rhythm.</strong> Peak times reward fast, accurate cooking, while quieter moments let you restock, explore the island or prepare ahead. As your rating increases, guests become more varied and demanding, turning each service into meaningful progress in your VR cooking career.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072850/extras/204c740a5f32e262fd8a5a0f20aea187.poster.avif?t=1777564046\" aria-label=\"Demonstration of the restaurant and guests in Isle Of Food\" width=614 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072850/extras/204c740a5f32e262fd8a5a0f20aea187.webm?t=1777564046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072850/extras/204c740a5f32e262fd8a5a0f20aea187.mp4?t=1777564046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>YOUR PATH AS A CHEF</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You begin with a small seaside kitchen and a short menu.</strong> Serving guests earns money and experience that unlock new tools, expand your recipes, improve the restaurant interior and refine your overall management strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reaching the 7-star level is the ultimate milestone.</strong> Higher ratings bring tougher orders, stricter ingredient requirements and greater rewards, attracting premium guests who seek the rarest dishes the island can offer. From your first simple meals to a fully developed 7-star restaurant, Isle of Food builds a complete VR cooking adventure you can progress through at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072850/extras/449002bee230b5e8ee92e66c61a4e90e.poster.avif?t=1777564046\" aria-label=\"Restaurant improvement in Isle of Food\" width=614 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072850/extras/449002bee230b5e8ee92e66c61a4e90e.webm?t=1777564046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072850/extras/449002bee230b5e8ee92e66c61a4e90e.mp4?t=1777564046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Coming in</strong> <strong>2026 — <u>ADD TO WISHLIST</u> and don’t miss the launch.</strong></h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072850/extras/b983cd26357111c3ca767895eede77e1.poster.avif?t=1777564046\" aria-label=\"Environment showcase in Isle Of Food\" width=614 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072850/extras/b983cd26357111c3ca767895eede77e1.webm?t=1777564046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.st